### Alert Description

The Security Operations Center (SOC) received an alert identifying excessive failed authentication attempts against Windows server `FS-01`.
The alert indicated that account `n.johnson` experienced repeated authentication failures originating from internal IP address `10.20.8.45`.
An investigation was initiated to determine whether the activity resulted from malicious authentication attempts, legitimate user error, or an improperly configured application or service.

